aphy_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"40b5bfd1","settings":{"editor":"<p>Many homeowners wait until their AC stops working entirely before calling for help. That may seem practical, but delaying service often makes the problem more expensive.<\/p><p>In Dry Prong and throughout Central Louisiana, cooling systems work hard through long, humid seasons. When a struggling AC continues running under heavy demand, small issues can quickly become major failures.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"f2a5b9d"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"5b3b0b13","settings":{"title":"Early Warning Signs: Address Problems Before They Escalate","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ad46eff"}],"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"439befd9","settings":{"editor":"<p>If your system is still running but not performing like it should, now is the time to schedule service.<br \/>Early AC repair can help you:<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"34d3241"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"742f73e1","settings":{"editor":"<ul><li><strong>Prevent Major Breakdowns:<\/strong> Small issues such as worn electrical components, low refrigerant, clogged drain lines, or airflow restrictions can worsen quickly when your system is running for hours each day.<\/li><li><strong>Protect Energy Efficiency:<\/strong> A struggling air conditioner often uses more energy while delivering less comfort. Repairing the issue early can help reduce unnecessary energy waste.<\/li><li><strong>Extend Equipment Lifespan:<\/strong> Prompt repairs reduce strain on important components and can help you get more years out of your system.<\/li><li><strong>Improve Indoor Comfort:<\/strong> If your home feels warm, humid, or unevenly cooled, <a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/when-you-need-ac-repair-service\/\">professional AC repair<\/a> can help restore more consistent comfort throughout your space.<\/li><\/ul>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"2876d55"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"61265fa1","settings":{"title":"Emergency AC Repairs: Fast Help When Comfort Cannot Wait","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ad46eff"}],"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2e048712","settings":{"container_type":"grid","presetTitle":"Grid","presetIcon":"eicon-container-grid","content_width":"full","grid_columns_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":2,"sizes":[]},"grid_rows_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":1,"sizes":[]},"_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4d47401"}]},"elements":[{"id":"4f5b94e8","settings":{"editor":"<p>Some AC issues need immediate attention, especially during extreme heat.<\/p><p>Call for emergency AC service if:<\/p><ul><li>Your system stops cooling completely<\/li><li>You smell burning or electrical odors<\/li><li>The AC repeatedly trips the breaker<\/li><li>Water is leaking near electrical components<\/li><li>Your home becomes unsafe or uncomfortable due to indoor heat<\/li><\/ul>","_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"c674808"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1785b2d9","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/hero-img.webp","id":13155,"size":"","alt":"hero-img","source":"library"},"image_size":"full","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ca7807d"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"17d36bde","settings":{"editor":"<p>Magnolia Air offers 24\/7 emergency service to help restore comfort when urgent cooling problems happen<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"165c689"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"6310266d","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/moesalley.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/phn-call.webp","id":12683,"size":"","alt":"phn call","source":"library"},"title_text":"24\/7 Emergency Service","description_text":"<a href=\"tel:318-233-9318\">(318) 233-9318<\/a>","position":"left","content_vertical_alignment":"middle","image_space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"image_size":{"unit":"%","size":15,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_typography":"custom","title_typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_weight":"300","title_typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"description_typography_typography":"custom","description_typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","description_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":38,"sizes":[]},"description_typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]},"description_typography_font_weight":"800","_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"px","size":384,"sizes":[]},"_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"6bd6571"}],"custom_css":"  div#call-cta-ip p.elementor-image-box-description a{\r\n      color: #fff!important;\r\n  }\r\n  div#call-cta-ip p.elementor-image-box-description a:hover{\r\n      color: #D4B351!important;\r\n  }\r\n@media (max-width: 767px){\r\n  div#call-cta-ip.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper {\r\n    display: flex !important;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n}  \r\ndiv#call-cta-ip .elementor-image-box-content {\r\n    text-align: left;\r\n    margin-left: 15px;\r\n}\r\n}\r\n","__globals__":{"description_color":"","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=text","_background_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent"},"_margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"-10","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_element_custom_width_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":270,"sizes":[]},"description_color":"#FFFFFF","title_bottom_space":{"unit":"px","size":0,"sizes":[]},"title_typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"description_typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":34,"sizes":[]},"_border_border":"none","_border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"3","right":"3","bottom":"3","left":"3","isLinked":true},"_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image-box","elType":"widget"},{"id":"4d12509e","settings":{"title":"Our Expert Diagnosis: What To Expect During An AC Repair Visit ","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2288bae8","settings":{"editor":"<p>When you call Magnolia Air for AC repair, our goal is not just to get your system running again. Our goal is to find the source of the issue, explain what is happening, and help you make a confident decision.<\/p><p>During your appointment, you can expect:<\/p><ul><li>A full inspection of your cooling system<\/li><li>Diagnostic testing to identify the root cause of the problem<\/li><li>Evaluation of airflow, refrigerant levels, electrical components, and thermostat operation<\/li><li>Inspection of the indoor air handler and outdoor condenser unit<\/li><li>Clear explanation of what needs repair and why<\/li><li>Honest recommendations based on your system\u2019s age, condition, and performance<\/li><li>Professional repair work using reliable parts and proven techniques<\/li><\/ul><p>Our technicians take the time to answer your questions, so you are not left guessing about your system or your options.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"f384e0b"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2b3fdecd","settings":{"title":"AC Repair Vs. Replacement: Knowing When A Repair Makes Sense","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7e8216d7","settings":{"container_type":"grid","presetTitle":"Grid","presetIcon":"eicon-container-grid","content_width":"full","grid_columns_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":2,"sizes":[]},"grid_rows_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":1,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"63242dd"}]},"elements":[{"id":"5f528a2c","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/IMG_2284-scaled.webp","id":13131,"size":"","alt":"AC Repair In Alexandria, LA","source":"library"},"image_size":"medium_large","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"c01c141"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"},{"id":"5732fc13","settings":{"editor":"<p>Not every AC problem means you need a new system. Many common issues, such as a failed capacitor, clogged condensate drain, thermostat malfunction, worn fan motor, or dirty coil, can often be repaired without replacing the entire unit.<\/p><p>However, replacement may be worth considering if:<\/p><ul><li>Your AC is more than 10 to 15 years old<\/li><li>Repairs are becoming frequent<\/li><li>The system struggles to cool your home even after service<\/li><li>Energy bills keep rising<\/li><li>Major components, such as the compressor, are failing<\/li><li>Your system uses outdated refrigerant<\/li><\/ul>","_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"d288f8e"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"5d258c75","settings":{"editor":"<p>At Magnolia Air, we help you compare your options clearly. If a repair makes sense, we will tell you. If replacement may be the better long-term investment, we will explain why and help you understand your choices.<\/p><p>Our goal is to help you make the right decision for your comfort, budget, and home.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"6f1a1c3"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"5eee9b50","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"10","bottom":"50","left":"10","isLinked":false},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4677bad"}]},"elements":[{"id":"785ca6a6","settings":{"title":"Reliable AC Repair Backed By Honest Guidance And Skilled Service ","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"22d41c6c","settings":{"editor":"<p>AC problems are stressful, especially when temperatures are high and your system is struggling to keep up. Magnolia Air is committed to making the repair process clear, responsive, and dependable from start to finish.<\/p><p>When you choose our team, you can expect:<\/p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","_padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ab32aea"}],"__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetTy